    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world as a millipede!<br><br>Millispeed is an arcade game where your primary goal is to get as long as possible. Eat pellets to grow segments and become a <strong>true millipede</strong> with 1,000 legs!  <br><br>If you get stuck, or eaten, you'll have to start over. More legs means a faster millipede. Can you control the chaos? Customize your millipede's colors and material whenever you'd like, and make it yours! <br><br>With both 'Peace' and 'Action' game modes, you get to choose the level of pressure. <br><br>In Action mode you'll need to watch out, hungry crows patrol the forest looking for a meal. Find a place to hide before your millipede becomes a bird buffet! Peace mode is a more laid back experience. Collect pellets and try to grow long without getting stuck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world as a millipede!<br><br>Millispeed is an arcade game where your primary goal is to get as long as possible. Eat pellets to grow segments and become a <strong>true millipede</strong> with 1,000 legs!  <br><br>If you get stuck, or eaten, you'll have to start over. More legs means a faster millipede. Can you control the chaos? Customize your millipede's colors and material whenever you'd like, and make it yours! <br><br>With both 'Peace' and 'Action' game modes, you get to choose the level of pressure. <br><br>In Action mode you'll need to watch out, hungry crows patrol the forest looking for a meal. Find a place to hide before your millipede becomes a bird buffet! Peace mode is a more laid back experience. Collect pellets and try to grow long without getting stuck.</p>",
    "short_description": "Eat. Grow. Survive.",
